        "answer": {
          "type": "categorical",
          "value": "Electronics sales rank East first (about 1300), North second (about 1200), then West and South—the top two are only ~100 units apart, but both sit well above the bottom half of the list, so the chart reads as a tight race at the top with a clearer drop toward the South.",
          "alternatives": []
        },
        "key_insights": [
          "Removing Clothing leaves a clean Electronics-only comparison across regions.",
          "East narrowly beats North; the sorted bars make that ordering and the ~100-point gap obvious."
